  "operation": "Recover the original APK native registration, position/rotation-offset/cache threshold, Awake/OnEnable/Update/OnDestroy order and original registration-failure flag. Bind the three verified collider-free, default-listener UI objects to the existing local five-event PCM host. Serialized prefab fields and source transform are preserved; standalone probe carriers isolate the original three documents only, not the game prefab.",
  "limitations": [
    "Only the three verified profession UI object configurations are supported. Non-default listeners, legacy offsets, collider/environment routing and destroy-trigger callbacks fail explicitly and remain outside this port.",
    "The local host uses the original missing-initialization-settings scaling fallback of 1. Spatial audio, general Wwise runtime and game-wide settings mixer are not implemented here.",
    "No full profession prefab or Windows Player validation has been performed."
  ],
  "validated_scope": "Passed Direct3D Play Mode after fixing the test scene AudioListener: all three original prefab field carriers and exact Awake registration/position/environment/listener/scaling order, actual-frame position/rotation offset/cache threshold, disable/destroy behavior, original failed-registration flag. All three register with the real local Windows host; an original catalog PCM event advances and yields nonzero output samples. ProjectTools.Validate and isolated static metadata check passed (73722 GUIDs). Complete UI and Player have not been exercised."
}
